{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "7c46c084c0623b092bc38d1d4b7185d385f76bbb5cf67fc4a350dadd3f78a35f", "ja": "悩みは人知れず", "zh": "不为人知的烦恼", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "894e626ed927a1dd19fc465b6742deb77ec0dee373edebf1ccd0ed16b9e5b8c9", "ja": "新曲のデモ音源が届きレッスンが始まった。\nだが順調そうに見えた莉緒がプロデューサー\nの元へとやってきて「勉強はしたけど、理解\nできない」と嘆く。落ち込む莉緒だったが、\nその夜、母からの電話で元気を取り戻す。", "zh": "新歌的示范音源送到了，课程开始了。\n但是，看起来进展顺利的莉绪来到制作人\n身边，哀叹道：“我已经学习过了，可还是\n理解不了。”虽然莉绪情绪低落，\n但那天晚上接到母亲的电话后，又恢复了精神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "448ae7a10304389b88574c6974056b0cd91c78d98248e4e8f16d6c5f58df8c3c", "ja": "（新曲のデモ音源が届き、イベントに向けて\nレッスンが始まった。慌ただしくなってきたな……）", "zh": "（新歌的试听音源送到了，为了活动开始了练习。最近变得越来越忙碌了啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "cdb7fd1de7159feb1df648c6dae2f1591ad573d480f0ab1923b6610fb8ce5040", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまなの～。\nレッスン終わったから、カギ返しにきたよ。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦～  \n我练习结束了，来还钥匙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e05db3b306023233dc89c6e936b859832b89ff92679108d396dfed39289dde0c", "ja": "ありがとう美希、お疲れさま。\nレッスンの調子はどうだ？", "zh": "谢谢你，美希，辛苦了。\n练习的进展怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "2d70949ef1360215a9af082edab5891e53664be2e7003c82f092f0380cb2fb92", "ja": "まだ始まったばっかりだけど、けっこういいカンジ？\nあと、気になるなら、見に来ればいいって思うな。", "zh": "虽然才刚开始，不过感觉还不错？\n还有，如果你在意的话，来看看不就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "b7b38d5aded83657f6245bdd7553fe00efdb820923a3ea06d288a060db44a089", "ja": "ハニーが見ててくれたら、\nミキ、もっともっとがんばれるかもしれないよ？", "zh": "如果亲爱的愿意看着我的话，\n美希说不定能更加更加努力哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "5f20596ebec649150bcb7ee204c4e224cd1e3ecc47c6dac978c1059cca7e1d82", "ja": "逆に～。見ててくれなかったら、\nミキのやる気がなくなっちゃうかもね？　あはっ。", "zh": "反过来说～。要是你不看着的话，\n美希可能就会失去干劲了哦？啊哈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "d01fe097ee4ca6da09c7167ec18e4ea004607fd08ea53bea1f74395b3d572348", "ja": "もちろん、見に行くよ。……あ、それと美希。\nこの前は美也のこと、ありがとうな。", "zh": "当然要去看啊。……啊，对了，美希。\n之前美也的事，谢谢你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "01090e6c2c0bbd9c34b1481c2b28209b3f00e4a883d7697271c46b04b8e155b2", "ja": "？　何のこと？", "zh": "？你说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f8aa2f83345b0360d3034311ec26e2d4e93c9e041437d7c1002ca24975b963f2", "ja": "仕事の見学をさせてもらったじゃないか。\n美也は、かなり参考になったみたいだ。", "zh": "不是让你参观过工作了吗？\n美也好像收获很大。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "51a69b3ce63a4549fe9a990101c45eea817b6aa388297b7f684080c703f99302", "ja": "ミキは何もしてないけど……。\nでも、美也のためになったなら、よかったね。", "zh": "美希什么都没做……不过，能帮到美也就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0dc3e5c3bc0c9f5927afb739859add4fa18c2ed1d0c7bf6860eee7be9d8ef62f", "ja": "うん、だからありがとう。美希にとっては、\nライバルが得をする結果になったかもしれないのに……", "zh": "嗯，所以谢谢你。明明对美希来说，这可能会变成让竞争对手得利的结果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "5a20c630b2e7e14354360be1dd5182848994dd70b06905cbbb80b6b5a5492f60", "ja": "別に気にしないよ。だってライバルが強い方が、\nみんなもっともっと、キラキラするでしょ？", "zh": "我才不在意呢。因为对手越强，大家不是就能更加更加闪耀了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "d73f97d329a96c7a7d831a8d78830c90c9d6419642d6feb13c86e1e1a155909e", "ja": "ミキ、ファッションショーもステージも、\nすっごく楽しみなの。ね、ハニー！", "zh": "美希非常期待时装秀和舞台表演。对吧，亲爱的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1013_p", "source_sha256": "889834df2d86d6381683bef8894277ad9605f2febc9ac65142f4dceaf48b16eb", "ja": "ああ、そうだな！", "zh": "没错，就是这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "6bf2ef5e517a0c55971795fb262b04ae1f110b7683aad3c2643e05e7eefc27d4", "ja": "（さて、と……今日の業務は一段落したかな。\nそろそろ切り上げて帰るとしようか）", "zh": "（好了……今天的工作差不多告一段落了吧。\n差不多该收拾收拾回去了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "0f4bd83e75ab98bd88ad333a6a470adccfc54aa10a02ead02f4f6084598e25bd", "ja": "{$P$}く～ん……。", "zh": "{$P$}君～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1017_p", "source_sha256": "83e02e6f2d965ee97be22afecf5696d0a2969c901b027b7ed96f040af867de28", "ja": "莉緒？　どうしたんだ、こんな時間まで。\nあ、飲みの誘いか？　一杯くらいなら付き合うけど。", "zh": "莉绪？怎么了，这么晚还没走。啊，是想叫我去喝酒吗？陪你喝一杯倒是可以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "c9da23ccb92e071c134491c3b1654df13f767b0acc491eadd5c2b0ec7e388463", "ja": "違うのよ～！\n今日はそういう気分じゃなくて……はぁ。", "zh": "不是那样啦～！今天没那个心情……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "2765624403f89f7e34f051ad106a658eed59db823d1079cbbc159a94af076f7c", "ja": "あれ、違うのか？\nイベントの準備は問題なさそうだし……。", "zh": "哎，不是吗？\n活动的筹备看起来也没什么问题啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1020_p", "source_sha256": "c6e432e049ba20cac360d83397898e1eb1381a9e12cc48d85ba391c262e6865c", "ja": "あの後、ジュリアが「助かった」って言ってたよ。\nこの分なら本番も何とかなりそうだって。莉緒も……。", "zh": "那之后，茱莉亚说了句“得救了”。照这个情况来看，正式演出应该也能顺利应付过去。莉绪也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "d0305ce55fd356c95dabc9ec5fd1734df85eb92b5c9fd09e324abc1c6e865276", "ja": "そ、それが……\n全然、ダメなのよ～～～！！！", "zh": "可、可是……\n完全不行啊～～～！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1022_p", "source_sha256": "284f68cd22db9f3ba8f63fb9a9bc70e6000b05416cb5d60c23adcf951e7bbc2e", "ja": "えっ！？　だ、ダメって、何がだ？", "zh": "诶！？不、不行？什么不行？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1023_046rio", "source_sha256": "2623f634b2b0e23ede6398dfb1b4413efb5ff044f75ee8ba94411c96ac11c931", "ja": "勉強はしたわよ！　したんだけど、\nどうしても理解できないのよ～……！！！", "zh": "我确实学习过了！确实学过，可是无论如何都理解不了啊～……！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1024_046rio", "source_sha256": "eb96edeb69088b2fd0c09822ab673087da9140910724a50b3e2c01f6678d3834", "ja": "だいたい、『病む』ってどういう状態をいうのよ！？\n頭に濡れタオルでも乗せておけばいいわけ～！！？", "zh": "说到底，“生病”到底是指什么状态啊！？\n只要在头上敷条湿毛巾就行了吗～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1025_p", "source_sha256": "614c810fd6c85a5400fa6b2c3927528364dcf75a709f3bbe79b664f19cf3ae20", "ja": "な、なるほど……？", "zh": "原、原来如此……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1026_p", "source_sha256": "ad11f64d47535c6a697b88313c8180e9a8f9b46c874f868c50cfdfcad040f0d6", "ja": "（莉緒は性格的に明るくて、暗い部分が薄いから……。\n地雷系、属性的に真逆という事になるのかな……？）", "zh": "（莉绪性格开朗，阴暗的一面也比较淡薄……所以从属性上来说，应该正好和地雷系完全相反吧……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1027_046rio", "source_sha256": "26d5c1a5988326d6ac8b090687f53195f920e9c58660946b24b948b61cf034db", "ja": "っていうか、{$P$}くんが\n悪いんじゃないの～！！？", "zh": "话说回来，不就是{$P$}你不对嘛～！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1028_p", "source_sha256": "62f172109021aad65ba1346cc65848ddb8dbfa7d0c14d6e077fd0708385692c1", "ja": "え、な、なんで？", "zh": "诶，什、什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1029_046rio", "source_sha256": "894173a901ba35a6d7c5728ff0db8b67711ce9d32ad868f834d044533b0d1185", "ja": "だって、いつも対応が完璧すぎるんだもの！\n私のこと、全然病ませてくれないじゃない！！", "zh": "因为你的应对总是完美得过头了！\n你根本就不给我陷入病娇的机会嘛！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1030_046rio", "source_sha256": "bd2162d64dcef9cdddaef826351297148eb42d8b529d3d60fe3b9edb7633a51e", "ja": "私が病んじゃうくらい、つれなくしてよね！", "zh": "你就对我冷淡一点嘛，冷淡到让我心里难受的那种！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "451c38ec68bb14ad2d2268ddb7a5141eff7b25353af0731026864b8a61c1b9f2", "ja": "ご、ごめん……？", "zh": "对、对不起……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1032_046rio", "source_sha256": "967bf8056ee5a99aa87a06323793ac3fd612dff00fc3d6985bf634616fcd6513", "ja": "ほらぁ、そういうとこ！　ほんと優しいんだから！\nこのままじゃ私、負けちゃうかもしれないのよ～！？", "zh": "看吧，就是这种地方！你真的太温柔了！\n这样下去，我说不定会输掉的哦～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1033_p", "source_sha256": "67d78dba1ffad1d16a618660dff4c7fbe511fa6f1d94d89096431c66be22466e", "ja": "す、すまない……。莉緒、今日のところは\n遅いし帰ろう。家まで送る……", "zh": "对、对不起……莉绪，今天已经很晚了，\n我们回去吧。我送你回家……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1034_p", "source_sha256": "6548d09ec1818631b975bd9a31227d8928f0a9be47874748a91b81f03fd46900", "ja": "あっ、送らない方がいいのか？", "zh": "啊，还是不送比较好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1035_046rio", "source_sha256": "baf3219164749bf432504ac1767ac82c17e0ebc0faf7737c0fc45932728b211e", "ja": "ダメ！　送って～～～っ！！", "zh": "不行！一定要发过来～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1037_046rio", "source_sha256": "55922eb93691d941595d218b28f1979974923402df7ce7bc6a9c65cbbb4aebaf", "ja": "はぁ……。帰ってきて落ち着いたら、\nなんだか恥ずかしくなってきちゃった。", "zh": "唉……回来冷静下来后，\n不知怎么的，开始觉得好害羞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1038_046rio", "source_sha256": "445bdec024e603a8ff1a666dd413cddf4cfdb7dd6374cb9d4cc28fccfcf5ccec", "ja": "何やってるんだろ。{$P$}くんに\n八つ当たりしたって、しょうがないのに……。", "zh": "我这是在做什么呀。明明就算拿{$P$}出气，也无济于事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1039_046rio", "source_sha256": "90f881c565498cda60eb4fed184e77a610819695f3ba4f66af62727d89b60502", "ja": "……でも、どうしたらいいのかしら？　せっかくの\nファッションショーで、みんなとの勝負なのに……。", "zh": "……可是，我该怎么办才好呢？难得有这次\n时装秀，而且还要和大家一较高下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1040_se", "source_sha256": "8d672fc290e4f5bb608e77c9c513ae831b878bcdb2a9947dcc94a54988e63289", "ja": "ブーッ！　ブーッ！", "zh": "哔──！哔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1041_046rio", "source_sha256": "edecee72d40e24eeb7d86d6b8844071947ec5c6ea168ce39db116a52f19c6c60", "ja": "っと……着信？　誰かしら……あら？\nもしもし、お母さん？　どしたん？", "zh": "呃……来电话了？会是谁呢……哎呀？\n喂，是妈妈吗？怎么啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1042_rionohahaoya", "source_sha256": "f1e892c4e2dc71119cc82c06bf7a0cba1d9da3b02da464f792adf8cd7afee038", "ja": "「あ、莉緒？　今日レモン送っといたけぇ、\n劇場のみんなで食べんさい」", "zh": "“啊，是莉绪吗？今天给你寄了柠檬，\n拿去和剧场的大家一起吃吧”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1043_046rio", "source_sha256": "7ab71a525055cfa63ceccc155c3b6ed03132ab8cf4ac7eac446025ab74726115", "ja": "わ、ありがとう～！　砂糖漬けにすると、\nみんな喜んでくれるんよ～。", "zh": "哇，谢谢啦～！腌成糖渍柠檬的话，\n大家都会好开心的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1044_046rio", "source_sha256": "1046b427d02eec447160bb9e0817d968fc1af1e1fbfe8858df0772505d84e6c4", "ja": "あ。ねえ、お母さん。\n私って子どもん頃、どんな子やった？", "zh": "啊。对了，妈妈。\n我小时候，是个什么样的孩子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1045_rionohahaoya", "source_sha256": "d86897a491b5f21e30bcf6bca8602ad5102f4318b0685a6f16eda86c09bfd264", "ja": "「なんね？　いきなり。ええ子じゃったよ。\nおかしなワガママも言わんかったけぇ」", "zh": "“怎么了？突然说这个。一直都是个好孩子。\n也没提过什么奇怪的任性要求。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1046_046rio", "source_sha256": "b0b837f9d0c20327c855236ddad9b485eae99a348a2f65f664876321aa4d4b66", "ja": "もうっ、それじゃダメなんよ～！！\nはぁ……私、アイドルに向いとらんのかも。", "zh": "真是的，那样可不行啦～！！\n唉……我可能真的不适合当偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1047_046rio", "source_sha256": "3b75b82e9425ea6dc7f2a42d0403329dad7cc9c0db13241e6ae17d30e3d7bccd", "ja": "自分のことも全然できとらんくせに、\nライバルにアドバイスなんかしよるけぇ……はぁ。", "zh": "自己连自己的事都完全搞不定，却还在给对手提什么建议……唉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1048_rionohahaoya", "source_sha256": "9be4897a8ef35a2e94544165c6435e3244f681b9d660a4c50f3e7933d8d43511", "ja": "「そこがあんたのええところじゃろ？\n心配いらん、あんたは自慢の娘じゃけぇ」", "zh": "“那不正是你的长处吗？\n不用担心，你可是让我引以为豪的女儿。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1049_046rio", "source_sha256": "9570e9353a819944f9bb1bfd20d4c85e61e7ddca832bd841605cb841ee911272", "ja": "お母さん……。", "zh": "妈妈……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1050_rionohahaoya", "source_sha256": "976d39e2d4613158f09f78438ca985ed1f0f694a30f5e1919350092ee768ca39", "ja": "「レモン食べんさい、レモン。元気出るけぇね」", "zh": "“吃点柠檬吧，柠檬。能让你打起精神来。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1051_046rio", "source_sha256": "78093fb2159be710e51b57251804f5d1948b350bfb50e4de1269631ef91d3446", "ja": "ふふっ、そうじゃねぇ！　そうする♪\nうん……うん！　ほいじゃ、また……うん！", "zh": "呵呵，不是那样！就这么做♪嗯……嗯！那就，回头见……嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1052_se", "source_sha256": "fab8835a5f8e3bdd4913bcb4e9a8ffa65e54a703681a2aec667ca24092cf0d0e", "ja": "ピッ", "zh": "嘀", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1053_046rio", "source_sha256": "eb820ebedd5bc36a3dfb8899f5248095b80826bb768b3a807f8f36f791e544ec", "ja": "ウフフ、すごく元気が出ちゃった。\nありがとうね、お母さん……。", "zh": "呵呵，不知不觉打起精神来了。\n谢谢你哦，妈妈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0386_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0386_story_05_1054_046rio", "source_sha256": "6bb1c50cf81f28dd084e6d9ad0cc8aa5dcda537fe881a6493eb811d80e1bea4b", "ja": "……って、元気が出たらダメなんだった！？\nあぁっ、もうっ！　どうしたらいいのよ～！！？", "zh": "……不对，打起精神来可不行啊！？\n啊～真是的！到底该怎么办才好啦～！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
